# Team Brain project config — PLACEHOLDERS ONLY (safe to commit).
# Each crew admin fills these with THEIR Supabase project (never commit live keys).
# Supabase "anon" key is a client key — RLS/RPCs protect data.
# Do NOT put service_role keys or member api_keys here.
#
# Admin (once): see supabase/README.md — create project → apply migrations → fill below
#   (or export TEAM_BRAIN_SUPABASE_URL / TEAM_BRAIN_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY / put them in
#   .team-brain/team.yaml). Then: register → share invite code with teammates.
#
# Joiners: need the crew's URL + anon (from your admin, Slack, etc.) in this file
#   or in team.yaml / env, plus: onboard <INVITE> "Your Name" [JIRA-KEY]

TEAM_BRAIN_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
TEAM_BRAIN_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
TEAM_BRAIN_JIRA_SITE=https://your-org.atlassian.net
